bR5cEr3H0TaG3i6v0YDZ5H91XCT9Sy-UsJPOZ_Js6cpFm3fak-T5BSe09EggBnllDwpZ0FnUBWu4dw8qjTA0DKJJN6mka3NgSqEr7_BBjaTU_PmVC3sMkx9tmIQGGdneqDYQAStNmOyps8MrE_uQU4ILj3wzG-WhvUUsp7sM4xXusSIMH2N6PlD-xnEloDJwVu_LV1q2QODrlaLdqkvWN20XC7MVnXCzXNcWAnnIYswHfa1a5mXHah7th1A?fife=w900", "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR62MrcpcAV7kT1flptYkmrkqyWH_IpUpf7i1C9EnrLPv29pgUItjzpXrNK-TM5VA0PwfTQP15_odax0mrIb1qK6mQ4uSPcrTnfqTybeAqy7Q8OMG6qPfZJLTTQdIR8PAnGpQOpYISDpugmrHe2y5qYK6h8Ju5sCkCHStyRCeLYOIqNDafvFGcrkJZE2aIGsg2qZlMsHnpeyxQPCZUnJilQO8I085f_IJvPiuodCg7rp4rr6nm3Sd4tGMyI?fife=w900"]}, {"id": 5, "name": "Felix Manz Marker", "country": "Switzerland", "lat": 47.3735228, "lng": 8.5419321, "description": "This marker along the west bank of the Limmat river marks the spot where Felix Manz was executed by drowning on January 5, 1527. The City Counsel of Zurich had made adult baptism punishable by drowning, and Felix Manz was sentenced subsequent to this edict. He was taken by boat into the river, and he was incapacitated by having his hand bound, passed behind his knees, and secured with a stick passed between his hands and knees. He was then drowned in the water.", "images": ["https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5GR9rOWNBxFTPwJ7IC36qLQZAu_QzIwx3m3anKLqmJBzJvBa_VLSWwXfNY3UCVXF7vdzExH8rDABHoeyG1wCjvEiBMd3845YR706z1LLqxVqcHQNnJhTfwiamZ6eMfbqC0lVktBSSALhlFGbzdMXzQWxBotaWw2myB0FNCOA8htJ9xh0qm8zesBKMGAxrz6HXSH1bIqrR0cbozbkJBDVgQ2QY7pUzvQwYNpSDophUmCAqaRMCJw9KnGrw?fife=w900", "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5uGk3QkgRnatiQ_-DugChLkTtrryz2WuC6PVci0mG3haVE0vtNIT-ApkSBRf29GqeCSJLCU7sh1LB9WwPlOyWpxEzZmB4lM_HmyCmg9qWiQ5KKNEtX4snzlNrB3N3kcTzWCBF_Adq0uWLIvzr_or4HuJNBuNsJlBDFWs_P1vBA04vwoh3x8o8BKctUupypvK8IfE1ZXnhfLgtYiwgvUwBMiXZttC8Vs8ef3Q7ewKyGOxPKOKVb7_yfj5k?fife=w900"]}, {"id": 6, "name": "Zürich Town Hall", "country": "Switzerland", "lat": 47.3715526, "lng": 8.5426815, "description": "The location for many of the disputations with the Zurich city council, the Protestant Reformers, and the first Anabaptists.", "images": ["https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7M2BGU5DpkAsA4pHaTmSU94EuxcbLqkNwg4jwo8SdCVSlW8U8zuqcGoNiKN8XNUrttxsj6d9XlCfJai_VnadJ7J0NPQrjzkqu53iFBdhjzQpQrce4c5f1VLeW5XpW_tWU0DkMxhJRTSpmvXwxQIho4ILPOYincwHGfhE2dlUHBPgEUC4EBc-8_1mZEMYZSppKBgxNacL3P9trwOP7s-Spd02KQNUfQgx236Y4QfIPt7OHoegXQ6FjCDe4?fife=w900"]}, {"id": 7, "name": "Felix Manz's Mother's House", "country": "Switzerland", "lat": 47.3697828, "lng": 8.5453411, "description": "This is the most likely location for the first adult baptisms in January 1525. Conrad Grebel did the first baptism at the request of George Blaurock.", "images": ["https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6mwq93FzySFyAV-RFeIJmz_Cg8_OiW9Cq7lCaft5QFiHUz8jmniSxJ4YC3ghksMJfcd69Ip9wJVSkc0SRXdbD9njocIxOicpGi5m26qyAxtB15aTzBtFznJ3JZAJzOJE-9FQWuctf6Ent3HowXSLmEy6ceqXSeq21mmfkeJ8H_N6qN0rKqHnSc-__Fc30Q4sdMk8bFKhyHh4HdQPro34ypUcChKaJYSGFGvkez8iC_hmvsonogd_PGlZQ?fife=w900", "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7tcoBmJKo5fBbeYVfZeSSRmOY7uUmcKX9tV0ya29RDbH00TAdvZloXOEEnt9z81VDk6xhKzXyKCQUqCBYzs6eSMm11gbWeFSJ1LTaci2buk2Bd7afcZPZeTx6hNpsFWN4z8FqjnP530S8_3IIsZKIrW5jQti_oF41FluHTBJBfrEmmBYeB25P60BqwtauZ4-Uc8QB3Kg7sthy3WpwQHCorwiko4spuS80DqlxjdQyqa78PdZBQlfXBqsQ?fife=w900"]}, {"id": 8, "name": "Conrad Grebel's House", "country": "Switzerland", "lat": 47.3726537, "lng": 8.5458107, "description": "The Grebel household was an important family in Zurich, with Conrad's father serving on the city council. Conrad lived in this house with his family until he was forced to flee the city as a wanted man.", "images": ["https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR5KkBd3xER-tcLnsBmvvdJvUxVfh5xuYNlmNA3FmlqKIwBRlVS3UM8o5KeRO3kak5S3CRV8GUepSSqWePOJFrT_xgALg2wkfpoxA3ufUlMYHWrJt2KBfhooXUaGRVw7tNjBxNBU0QM73XebaZpqyBKCRjqp6-H8zsXVpEkNQRrh52JKihcQdT9cvedb7HmMWuj5miS79yd23MNk7TzaW9XyGajWGcuudiexv7_BtvijrupldIG